<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-03-06"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Elio Hbeich"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Ontology module for representing concrete observations, declarations and settings about textile use, care, environmental exposure, storage and user behaviour. Context factor types are represented as SKOS concepts; processes and process parameters remain in TEXTILE_PROCESS."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-03-06"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
