<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-07-16"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://susproc.jrc.ec.europa.eu/product-bureau/sites/default/files/2025-12/Textile-Prep-Study_3rd-Milestone_20251212.pdf> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "EU DPP Textile Context Ontology"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "txtctx" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-context#" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A context observation is not a textile process, process parameter, assessment result or derived indicator. Washing temperature and similar operational settings remain represented through TEXTILE_PROCESS."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-context> .
