<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "Version 1.1.2" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "JRC 3rd milestone, Sections 6.3 (pages 84-87, lines 2105-2244), 9.2.2.2 (pages 125-126, lines 3296-3327), and 13.7.2 (pages 395-410, lines 10227-10646)."@en .
